---
// Lightweight Goroutines (2 KB growable stack) vs heavy OS Threads + sync.WaitGroup lifecycle.
const W = 900;
const H = 282;
---
<figure class="gf3b">
  <div class="gf3b-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Comparison of heavy OS threads versus lightweight 2 KB Go goroutines plus the sync.WaitGroup Add, defer Done, Wait barrier pattern.">
      {/* Left panel: Goroutine vs OS Thread */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="424" height="254" rx="10" class="gf3b-card" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="gf3b-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Goroutine (~2 KB) vs. OS Thread (~1–2 MB)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Goroutine (~2 KB) vs. OS Thread (~1–2 MB)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="60" width="392" height="72" rx="6" class="gf3b-box is-red" />
      <text x="44" y="80" class="gf3b-b-red">OS Thread: 1–2 MB fixed stack + Kernel trap switch</text>
      <text x="44" y="100" class="gf3b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>50,000 OS threads burn ~50 GB RAM &amp; stall scheduling.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tạo 50.000 OS thread tốn ~50 GB RAM và kẹt chuyển mạch.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="142" width="392" height="110" rx="6" class="gf3b-box is-ok" />
      <text x="44" y="162" class="gf3b-b-ok">go handleReq(ctx)  // Goroutine starts at ~2 KB!</text>
      <text x="44" y="182" class="gf3b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Grows/shrinks dynamically in Go's user-space scheduler.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Stack tự co giãn; Go runtime tự xếp hàng vạn goroutine</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="200" class="gf3b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>100,000 goroutines share ~8 OS threads cleanly.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>chạy mượt trên vài OS thread mà không gọi kernel switch.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="222" class="gf3b-b">Remember: "Concurrency != Parallelism" (structure vs cores).</text>

      {/* Right panel: sync.WaitGroup lifecycle */}
      <rect x="458" y="14" width="428" height="254" rx="10" class="gf3b-card is-ok" />
      <text x="474" y="42" class="gf3b-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Wait Deterministically via sync.WaitGroup</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Đợi hoàn tất chuẩn chỉnh bằng sync.WaitGroup</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="474" y="60" width="396" height="54" rx="6" class="gf3b-box" />
      <text x="488" y="80" class="gf3b-b">Step A: wg.Add(1) BEFORE launching go func()</text>
      <text x="488" y="99" class="gf3b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Calling wg.Add(1) inside worker races against wg.Wait()!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đặt wg.Add trong goroutine con làm Wait() chạy trượt!</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="474" y="124" width="396" height="58" rx="6" class="gf3b-box is-ok" />
      <text x="488" y="144" class="gf3b-b-ok">Step B: defer wg.Done() right at goroutine top</text>
      <text x="488" y="163" class="gf3b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Guarantees counter decrements even on early return.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đặt defer wg.Done() đầu hàm để trả đếm dù return sớm.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="474" y="192" width="396" height="60" rx="6" class="gf3b-box" />
      <text x="488" y="212" class="gf3b-b">Step C: wg.Wait() (never time.Sleep for goroutines!)</text>
      <text x="488" y="231" class="gf3b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>main exiting kills all background goroutines abruptly.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Hàm main() thoát sẽ ngắt hết goroutine con nếu quên Wait().</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Prefix any call with `go` to launch a ~2 KB goroutine managed by Go's scheduler, and coordinate completion cleanly with wg.Add(1) before the spawn, defer wg.Done() inside, and wg.Wait().</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Chỉ cần thêm từ khóa `go` trước lời gọi hàm để chạy song song ở mức ~2 KB RAM, và luôn chốt đếm wg.Add(1) trước khi go, defer wg.Done() bên trong rồi mới gọi wg.Wait().</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gf3b { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gf3b-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gf3b svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gf3b text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gf3b-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gf3b-card.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf3b-card.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf3b-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gf3b-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .gf3b-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf3b-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf3b-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gf3b-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gf3b-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gf3b-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf3b-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf3b-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .gf3b figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
